senses.gloss:
बन्धुक, अस्, m. a species of plant (= बन्-
धूक, बन्धु-जीव); a bastard [cf. बन्धुल];
(आ, ई), f. an unchaste woman (= बन्धकी).

बन्धुल, अस्, आ, अम्, bent, inclined, depressed;
pleasing, charming; (अस्), m. an attendant in the
chamber of a harlot; the son of a harlot, a bastard;
Pentapetes Phœnicea; N. of a Ṛṣi.
—बन्धुलान्-
वय (˚ल-अन्˚), अस्, m. the posterity of Bandhula.
